File ini digunakan untuk menguji API menggunakan ekstensi VS Code REST Client.

Environment note:
Pastikan kamu sudah memilih Environment 'local' di kanan bawah VS Code.
Base URL diambil dari variabel 'baseUrl' di .rest-client.env.json

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}

1. ROOT TEST (Cek Server Hidup)

GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

Expected: 200 OK, response: { "message": "API Works! (Health Check OK)" }

2. REGISTER (Buat Akun Baru)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "email": "test@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

Expected: 201 Created atau 200 OK. Response: { user: {...} } atau { message: "..." }

###############################################
REQUEST SENSITIF BERIKUT AKAN MENGGANTUNGKAN PADA TOKEN
PASTIKAN KAMU SUDAH MENGATUR SCRIPT OTOMATIS DI POSTMAN COLLECTION
###############################################
3. LOGIN (Dapatkan Bearer Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "email": "test@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

Expected: 200 OK. Response body: { "token": "..." }
Catatan: Jika menggunakan .rest-client.env.json, kamu harus memasukkan token manual ke dalamnya.

4. ME (Protected Route - Akses dengan Token Manual)
NOTE: GANTI <TOKEN_KAMU> DENGAN TOKEN JWT HASIL LOGIN!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_KAMU>
Accept: application/json
Expected: 200 OK + Informasi pengguna.

###############################################
NEGATIVE TESTING 
###############################################
5. TEST TANPA TOKEN (Harus Error 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Expected: 401 Unauthorized (atau 403 Forbidden)

6. TEST REGISTER INVALID (Email/Password Salah)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123"
}

Expected: 400 Bad Request + pesan validasi
7. TEST LOGIN PASSWORD SALAH (Harus Error 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "email": "test@mail.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

Expected: 401 Unauthorized atau 400 Bad Request